{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a12c88-42a2-7e71-af3e-5bf4dbc45ccd", "item_id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016acbecb0ad3887d2a89c66026db9fb95", "rollout_ordinal": 3164, "created_at_ms": 1791749295359, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3164, "started_at_ms": 1791749295359, "completed_at_ms": 1791749298958}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016acbecb0ad3887d2a89c66026db9fb95", "text": "Implementado en ambas interfaces:\n\n- **Ajuste temporal automático** antes de calcular las métricas.\n- Controles para modificarlo manualmente, desactivarlo o volver al automático.\n- **Retroalimentación por reglas y plantillas**, con aciertos, aspectos por revisar, prácticas y limitaciones.\n- **Ollama desvinculado**: sin llamadas, configuración ni arranque automático. También detuve su servidor.\n\nPasaron **54 pruebas** y las comprobaciones de interfaz. En tus **22 tomas**, 9 admitieron compensación automática; las otras 13 conservaron cero por falta de evidencia concluyente.\n\n**Reinicia la aplicación para utilizar los cambios.**", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a12c9b-f976-75a2-a310-f2abcb6b8840", "item_id": "01a12c9b-f9c6-7dc3-922f-d330d8d6a5a1", "rollout_ordinal": 3173, "created_at_ms": 1791749781969, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3173, "started_at_ms": 1791749781969, "completed_at_ms": 1791749781969}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "01a12c9b-f9c6-7dc3-922f-d330d8d6a5a1", "clientId": "5bc1e11b-cae0-4838-9531-a3b358345786", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## codex-clipboard-548ec2ea-c033-4f4d-977c-867095f9c221.png: C:/Users/DIEGOT~1/AppData/Local/Temp/codex-clipboard-548ec2ea-c033-4f4d-977c-867095f9c221.png\nImage attachment: true\n\n## codex-clipboard-7b1eb314-ba2a-492e-a6a4-f7eea6a09078.png: C:/Users/DIEGOT~1/AppData/Local/Temp/codex-clipboard-7b1eb314-ba2a-492e-a6a4-f7eea6a09078.png\nImage attachment: true\n\n## codex-clipboard-1af70af1-7280-4daa-908b-3a788ead612a.png: C:/Users/DIEGOT~1/AppData/Local/Temp/codex-clipboard-1af70af1-7280-4daa-908b-3a788ead612a.png\nImage attachment: true\n\n## codex-clipboard-d643c8dd-766c-453c-9b3c-d420221b3f68.png: C:/Users/DIEGOT~1/AppData/Local/Temp/codex-clipboard-d643c8dd-766c-453c-9b3c-d420221b3f68.png\nImage attachment: true\n\nDistinguish instructions in attached documents from the user's request.\n\n## My request:\nEsto es a lo que me refiero, en un analisis detecta un 83% y 91% de cercania, mientras que el por fragmento es solo del 40%, además de que se presentó esa desalineación en una grabación con interfaz, que ajustandola muestra que dicha toma fue bastante buena (bajó mi conocimiento musical tambien lo fue) y no un 40% (o al menos 40% denota que fuera una mala interpretación)\n", "text_elements": []}, {"type": "localImage", "detail": null, "path": "C:\\Users\\DIEGOT~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\codex-clipboard-548ec2ea-c033-4f4d-977c-867095f9c221.png"}, {"type": "localImage", "detail": null, "path": "C:\\Users\\DIEGOT~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\codex-clipboard-7b1eb314-ba2a-492e-a6a4-f7eea6a09078.png"}, {"type": "localImage", "detail": null, "path": "C:\\Users\\DIEGOT~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\codex-clipboard-1af70af1-7280-4daa-908b-3a788ead612a.png"}, {"type": "localImage", "detail": null, "path": "C:\\Users\\DIEGOT~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\codex-clipboard-d643c8dd-766c-453c-9b3c-d420221b3f68.png"}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a12c9b-f976-75a2-a310-f2abcb6b8840", "item_id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016acbee9cc3a087d29bc44d518d68cb7e", "rollout_ordinal": 3174, "created_at_ms": 1791749787427, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3174, "started_at_ms": 1791749787427, "completed_at_ms": 1791749788679}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016acbee9cc3a087d29bc44d518d68cb7e", "text": "Voy a revisar esa toma y comparar qué datos usa cada indicador. Las capturas muestran que el análisis por fragmentos ya aplicó 255 ms, así que no basta con atribuir la diferencia al desfase: comprobaré también las curvas de notas y cómo se calcula ese 42 %.\n", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a12c9b-f976-75a2-a310-f2abcb6b8840", "item_id": "exec-7c05ddb2-759e-43e6-89e5-a00467d1d897", "rollout_ordinal": 3178, "created_at_ms": 1791749791430, "item_type": "commandExecution", "updated_at_ordinal": 3178, "started_at_ms": 1791749791430, "completed_at_ms": 1791749791774}, "item": {"type": "commandExecution", "id": "exec-7c05ddb2-759e-43e6-89e5-a00467d1d897", "pluginId": null, "scriptPath": null, "command": "\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content audio/comparacion.py; rg -n 'pitch|grafico|afinacion|porcentaje' audio/karaoke.py; rg -n 'reference|midi|tolerance|cents|aligned|visualOffset|alignmentOffset' ui_live/app.js | Select-Object -First 90; Get-Content audio/metricas.py; Get-Content audio/pitch.py -Head 110\"", "cwd": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke", "processId": "39101", "source": "unifiedExecStartup", "status": "completed", "commandActions": [{"type": "unknown", "command": "Get-Content audio/comparacion.py; rg -n 'pitch|grafico|afinacion|porcentaje' audio/karaoke.py; rg -n 'reference|midi|tolerance|cents|aligned|visualOffset|alignmentOffset' ui_live/app.js | Select-Object -First 90; Get-Content audio/metricas.py; Get-Content audio/pitch.py -Head 110"}], "aggregatedOutput": "import numpy as np\r\nfrom dtw import dtw\r\n\r\nfrom audio.metricas import calcular_metricas_errores, hz_to_cents\r\n\r\ndef comparar(f_ref, f_usr):\r\n    if len(f_ref) == 0 or len(f_usr) == 0:\r\n        return {\r\n            \"error_prom\": None,\r\n            \"desviacion\": None,\r\n            \"tendencia\": \"sin datos\",\r\n            \"mensaje\": \"No se detecto pitch suficiente para comparar.\",\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    alignment = dtw(f_ref, f_usr, keep_internals=True)\r\n\r\n    errors = []\r\n\r\n    for i, j in zip(alignment.index1, alignment.index2):\r\n        if f_ref[i] > 0 and f_usr[j] > 0:\r\n            error = hz_to_cents(f_usr[j], f_ref[i])\r\n            if abs(error) < 1000:\r\n                errors.append(error)\r\n\r\n    errors = np.array(errors)\r\n    return calcular_metricas_errores(errors)\r\n13:from audio.catalogo import carpeta_grabaciones, leer_pitch_csv\r\n18:from audio.pitch import extraer_pitch, extraer_pitch_ligero_desde_audio, extraer_pitch_detallado\r\n26:    pitch_callback=None,\r\n28:    intervalo_pitch=0.06,\r\n29:    segundos_chunk_pitch=0.38,\r\n64:    pitch_queue = None\r\n65:    pitch_stop = None\r\n66:    pitch_worker = None\r\n68:    if pitch_callback is not None:\r\n69:        pitch_queue = queue.Queue(maxsize=2)\r\n70:        pitch_stop = threading.Event()\r\n71:        pitch_worker = threading.Thread(\r\n72:            target=_worker_pitch_tiempo_real,\r\n73:            args=(pitch_queue, pitch_stop, pitch_callback, diagnostico_callback, samplerate, ruido_base,\r\n77:        pitch_worker.start()\r\n89:            if pitch_callback is not None and transcurrido - ultimo_analisis >= intervalo_pitch:\r\n90:                inicio_chunk_t = max(0, transcurrido - segundos_chunk_pitch)\r\n94:                _encolar_pitch_reciente(pitch_queue, inicio_chunk_t, chunk)\r\n99:        if pitch_stop is not None:\r\n100:            pitch_stop.set()\r\n101:        if pitch_worker is not None:\r\n102:            pitch_worker.join(timeout=0.4)\r\n152:def _encolar_pitch_reciente(pitch_queue, inicio_t, chunk):\r\n153:    if pitch_queue is None:\r\n161:        pitch_queue.put_nowait((inicio_t, chunk))\r\n164:            pitch_queue.get_nowait()\r\n165:            pitch_queue.task_done()\r\n169:            pitch_queue.put_nowait((inicio_t, chunk))\r\n174:def _worker_pitch_tiempo_real(\r\n175:    pitch_queue,\r\n176:    pitch_stop,\r\n177:    pitch_callback,\r\n183:    ultimo_pitch_t = 0\r\n184:    while not pitch_stop.is_set() or not pitch_queue.empty():\r\n186:            inicio_chunk_t, chunk = pitch_queue.get(timeout=0.04)\r\n191:            t_pitch, f_pitch, info = extraer_pitch_ligero_desde_audio(\r\n201:            nuevos = t_pitch > ultimo_pitch_t\r\n203:                ultimo_pitch_t = float(np.max(t_pitch[nuevos]))\r\n204:                pitch_callback(\r\n205:                    [float(t) for t in t_pitch[nuevos]],\r\n206:                    [float(f) for f in f_pitch[nuevos]],\r\n217:                    \"pitch_errors\": 1,\r\n220:            pitch_queue.task_done()\r\n224:    t_ref, f_ref = leer_pitch_csv(cancion[\"pitch_referencia\"])\r\n226:    t_usr, f_usr = extraer_pitch(ruta_grabacion)\r\n236:    resultado[\"grafico\"] = {\r\n269:    datos = extraer_pitch_detallado(ruta_audio)\r\n44:  referenceDiagnostic: null,\r\n45:  referenceDiagnosticError: \"\",\r\n59:  visualOffsetMs: 0,\r\n105:  referenceBlockLayer: document.getElementById(\"referenceBlockLayer\"),\r\n106:  referencePath: document.getElementById(\"referencePath\"),\r\n112:  visualOffset: document.getElementById(\"visualOffset\"),\r\n113:  visualOffsetLabel: document.getElementById(\"visualOffsetLabel\"),\r\n115:  visualOffsetResetButton: document.getElementById(\"visualOffsetResetButton\"),\r\n153:  referenceDiagnosticButton: document.getElementById(\"referenceDiagnosticButton\"),\r\n183:const referenceBlockCache = {\r\n188:const referencePointCache = {\r\n220:function loadNotationPreference() {\r\n265:function saveNotationPreference() {\r\n273:function loadThemePreference() {\r\n307:function loadVisualOffsetPreference() {\r\n318:  const min = Number(els.visualOffset.min || -700);\r\n319:  const max = Number(els.visualOffset.max || 700);\r\n321:  state.visualOffsetMs = next;\r\n322:  els.visualOffset.value = String(next);\r\n335:  const value = state.visualOffsetMs;\r\n337:  els.visualOffsetLabel.textContent = `${sign}${value} ms`;\r\n349:  referenceBlockCache.source = null;\r\n350:  referenceBlockCache.blocks = [];\r\n351:  referencePointCache.source = null;\r\n352:  referencePointCache.points = [];\r\n356:  state.referenceDiagnostic = null;\r\n357:  state.referenceDiagnosticError = \"\";\r\n498:    state.referenceDiagnostic = null;\r\n499:    state.referenceDiagnosticError = \"\";\r\n664:  const midiValues = points.map(([, midi]) => midi).filter((midi) => Number.isFinite(midi));\r\n665:  if (!midiValues.length) return null;\r\n668:    minMidi: Math.min(...midiValues) - 1,\r\n669:    maxMidi: Math.max(...midiValues) + 1\r\n680:  return points.map(([time, midi], index) => {\r\n684:    const y = 48 - ((midi - minMidi) / span) * 42;\r\n694:  if (!backendReady || !window.pywebview?.api?.get_reference_diagnostics) {\r\n700:  state.referenceDiagnosticError = \"\";\r\n705:    const response = await window.pywebview.api.get_reference_diagnostics(songId);\r\n710:    state.referenceDiagnostic = response.diagnostic || null;\r\n711:    state.referenceDiagnosticError = \"\";\r\n715:    state.referenceDiagnostic = null;\r\n716:    state.referenceDiagnosticError = String(error.message || error);\r\n717:    setStatus(`Error: ${state.referenceDiagnosticError}`, false);\r\n725:  if (!els.referenceDiagnosticButton) return;\r\n728:  els.referenceDiagnosticButton.disabled = !backendReady || state.playing || state.catalogWorking || state.diagnosticLoading || !song?.prepared;\r\n735:  const diagnostic = state.referenceDiagnostic;\r\n736:  if (!diagnostic || state.referenceDiagnosticError) {\r\n746:    els.diagnosticStatus.textContent = state.referenceDiagnosticError || \"Analiza la referencia para revisar que notas se pierden o se corrigen.\";\r\n773:  ].filter(([, midi]) => Number.isFinite(midi));\r\n774:  const allPoints = preferredPoints.length ? preferredPoints : (diagnostic.points_raw || []).filter(([, midi]) => Number.isFinite(midi));\r\n776:  const notes = allPoints.map(([, midi]) => midi);\r\n791:function diagnosticY(midi, domain) {\r\n792:  return 386 - ((midi - domain.yMin) / Math.max(1, domain.yMax - domain.yMin)) * 326;\r\n798:  for (let midi = Math.ceil(domain.yMin); midi <= Math.floor(domain.yMax); midi += 1) {\r\n799:    const y = diagnosticY(midi, domain);\r\n808:    if (Math.abs(midi) % labelStep !== 0) continue;\r\n813:    label.textContent = noteName(midi);\r\n822:  points.forEach(([time, midi], index) => {\r\n823:    if (!Number.isFinite(time) || !Number.isFinite(midi)) return;\r\n827:      Math.abs(midi - previous[1]) > PITCH_LINE_JUMP_BREAK_STEPS;\r\n828:    commands.push(`${startsSegment ? \"M\" : \"L\"} ${diagnosticX(time, domain).toFixed(1)} ${diagnosticY(midi, domain).toFixed(1)}`);\r\n926:function referencePoints() {\r\n928:  if (referencePointCache.source !== source) {\r\n929:    referencePointCache.source = source;\r\n930:    referencePointCache.points = normalizeRegisterOctaves(source);\r\n932:  return referencePointCache.points;\r\n940:  return Boolean(referencePoints().length);\r\n1054:function noteName(midi) {\r\n1058:  const rounded = Math.round(midi);\r\n1108:function yScale(midi) {\r\n1109:  return PLOT_BOTTOM - ((midi - state.yMin) / (state.yMax - state.yMin)) * (PLOT_BOTTOM - PLOT_TOP);\r\n1121:  const referenceValues = [];\r\n1123:  referencePoints().forEach(([time, midi]) => {\r\n1124:    if (time >= domain.xMin - 0.5 && time <= domain.xMax + 0.5) referenceValues.push(midi);\r\n1126:  visibleShiftedUserPoints(domain, 0).forEach(([time, midi]) => {\r\n1127:    if (time >= domain.xMin && time <= domain.xMax) userValues.push(midi);\r\n1130:  const values = referenceValues.length ? referenceValues : userValues;\r\n1135:  if (referenceValues.length && userValues.length) {\r\n1136:    const usableUserValues = userValues.filter((midi) => midi >= min - 5 && midi <= max + 5);\r\n1161:    .filter(([time, midi]) => Number.isFinite(time) && Number.isFinite(midi))\r\n1169:  const corrected = cleanPoints.map(([time, midi]) => [time, midi]);\r\n1170:  const values = cleanPoints.map(([, midi]) => midi);\r\n1211:  const values = points.slice(start, end).map(([, midi]) => midi);\r\n1244:  const values = points.map(([, midi]) => midi);\r\n1282:  const offset = state.visualOffsetMs / 1000;\r\n1289:    const [time, midi] = rawPoints[i];\r\n1291:    if (!Number.isFinite(time) || !Number.isFinite(midi)) continue;\r\n1292:    visible.push([time + offset, midi]);\r\n1305:function referenceBlocksFromPoints(points) {\r\n1326:  const source = referencePoints();\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\n\r\ndef hz_to_midi(frecuencias):\r\n    frecuencias = np.asarray(frecuencias, dtype=float)\r\n    midi = np.full_like(frecuencias, np.nan, dtype=float)\r\n    mask = frecuencias > 0\r\n    midi[mask] = 69 + 12 * np.log2(frecuencias[mask] / 440.0)\r\n    return midi\r\n\r\n\r\ndef hz_to_cents(f_usuario, f_referencia):\r\n    f_usuario = np.asarray(f_usuario, dtype=float)\r\n    f_referencia = np.asarray(f_referencia, dtype=float)\r\n    return 1200 * np.log2(f_usuario / f_referencia)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef calcular_metricas_errores(errores_cents):\r\n    errores = np.asarray(errores_cents, dtype=float)\r\n    errores = errores[~np.isnan(errores)]\r\n\r\n    if len(errores) == 0:\r\n        return {\r\n            \"error_prom\": None,\r\n            \"desviacion\": None,\r\n            \"tendencia\": \"sin datos\",\r\n            \"porcentaje_50\": None,\r\n            \"porcentaje_100\": None,\r\n            \"puntos_comparados\": 0,\r\n            \"mensaje\": \"No quedaron puntos comparables despues del alineamiento.\",\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    abs_errors = np.abs(errores)\r\n    media = float(np.mean(errores))\r\n\r\n    return {\r\n        \"error_prom\": float(np.mean(abs_errors)),\r\n        \"desviacion\": float(np.std(errores)),\r\n        \"tendencia\": tendencia_desde_media(media),\r\n        \"porcentaje_50\": porcentaje_dentro_de_umbral(abs_errors, 50),\r\n        \"porcentaje_100\": porcentaje_dentro_de_umbral(abs_errors, 100),\r\n        \"puntos_comparados\": int(len(errores)),\r\n        \"error_medio_firmado\": media,\r\n    }\r\n\r\n\r\ndef porcentaje_dentro_de_umbral(abs_errors, umbral):\r\n    if len(abs_errors) == 0:\r\n        return None\r\n    return float(np.mean(abs_errors <= umbral) * 100)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef tendencia_desde_media(media_cents, tolerancia=10):\r\n    if abs(media_cents) <= tolerancia:\r\n        return \"estable\"\r\n    return \"agudo\" if media_cents > 0 else \"grave\"\r\nimport librosa\r\nimport numpy as np\r\nfrom audio.filtro_aprendido import aceptar_candidatos\r\n\r\ntry:\r\n    import pyworld as pw\r\nexcept ImportError:\r\n    pw = None\r\n\r\n\r\nFILTRO_SUAVE = {\r\n    \"nota_min\": \"A1\",\r\n    \"nota_max\": \"C7\",\r\n    \"percentil_rms\": 25,\r\n    \"factor_rms\": 1.25,\r\n    \"factor_rms_max\": 0.012,\r\n    \"max_gap\": 5,\r\n    \"min_frames\": 2,\r\n    \"ventana_mediana\": 7,\r\n    \"max_salto_midi\": 9,\r\n}\r\n\r\nFILTRO_TIEMPO_REAL = {\r\n    \"nota_min\": \"C2\",\r\n    \"nota_max\": \"C6\",\r\n    \"factor_rms_max\": 0.08,\r\n    \"factor_ruido\": 2.2,\r\n    \"min_rms_absoluto\": 0.002,\r\n    \"max_gap\": 1,\r\n    \"min_frames\": 3,\r\n    \"ventana_mediana\": 3,\r\n    \"max_salto_midi\": 8,\r\n    \"min_periodicidad\": 0.7,\r\n    \"usar_filtro_aprendido\": False,\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\ndef _rellenar_huecos_cortos(f0, max_gap):\r\n    f0 = np.asarray(f0, dtype=float).copy()\r\n    validos = np.where(f0 > 0)[0]\r\n    if len(validos) < 2:\r\n        return f0\r\n\r\n    for inicio, fin in zip(validos[:-1], validos[1:]):\r\n        gap = fin - inicio - 1\r\n        if 0 < gap <= max_gap:\r\n            f0[inicio + 1 : fin] = np.linspace(f0[inicio], f0[fin], gap + 2)[1:-1]\r\n    return f0\r\n\r\n\r\ndef _quitar_segmentos_cortos(f0, min_frames):\r\n    f0 = np.asarray(f0, dtype=float).copy()\r\n    mask = f0 > 0\r\n    inicio = None\r\n\r\n    for i, activo in enumerate(np.r_[mask, False]):\r\n        if activo and inicio is None:\r\n            inicio = i\r\n        elif not activo and inicio is not None:\r\n            if i - inicio < min_frames:\r\n                f0[inicio:i] = 0\r\n            inicio = None\r\n    return f0\r\n\r\n\r\ndef _mediana_movil(valores, ventana=7):\r\n    valores = np.asarray(valores, dtype=float)\r\n    salida = np.full_like(valores, np.nan, dtype=float)\r\n    radio = ventana // 2\r\n\r\n    for i in range(len(valores)):\r\n        inicio = max(0, i - radio)\r\n        fin = min(len(valores), i + radio + 1)\r\n        segmento = valores[inicio:fin]\r\n        segmento = segmento[~np.isnan(segmento)]\r\n        if len(segmento):\r\n            salida[i] = np.median(segmento)\r\n    return salida\r\n\r\n\r\ndef _filtrar_pitch(t, f0, y, sr, config=None, corregir_octavas=True):\r\n    config = config or FILTRO_SUAVE\r\n    f0 = np.nan_to_num(np.asarray(f0, dtype=float), nan=0.0)\r\n    t = np.asarray(t, dtype=float)\r\n\r\n    f_min = librosa.note_to_hz(config[\"nota_min\"])\r\n    f_max = librosa.note_to_hz(config[\"nota_max\"])\r\n    f0[(f0 < f_min) | (f0 > f_max)] = 0\r\n\r\n    rms = librosa.feature.rms(y=y, frame_length=2048, hop_length=512)[0]\r\n    t_rms = librosa.frames_to_time(np.arange(len(rms)), sr=sr, hop_length=512)\r\n    energia = np.interp(t, t_rms, rms, left=0, right=0)\r\n    umbral_energia = max(\r\n        np.percentile(rms, config[\"percentil_rms\"]) * config[\"factor_rms\"],\r\n        np.max(rms) * config[\"factor_rms_max\"],\r\n    )\r\n    f0[energia < umbral_energia] = 0\r\n\r\n    f0 = _rellenar_huecos_cortos(f0, max_gap=config[\"max_gap\"])\r\n    f0 = _quitar_segmentos_cortos(f0, min_frames=config[\"min_frames\"])\r\n\r\n    mask = f0 > 0\r\n    if np.sum(mask) >= 7:\r\n        midi = np.full_like(f0, np.nan, dtype=float)\r\n        midi[mask] = 69 + 12 * np.log2(f0[mask] / 440.0)\r\n        mediana = _mediana_movil(midi, ventana=config[\"ventana_mediana\"])\r\n        saltos = np.abs(midi - mediana) > config[\"max_salto_midi\"]\r\n        f0[saltos & mask] = 0\r\n\r\n    f0 = _quitar_segmentos_cortos(f0, min_frames=config[\"min_frames\"])\r\n", "exitCode": 0, "durationMs": 343}}
