{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a12e0a-5ef3-7252-8a59-c56f2a4333c8", "item_id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016acc4d59b72c87d28d610b507e5ce0d0", "rollout_ordinal": 3402, "created_at_ms": 1791774041459, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3402, "started_at_ms": 1791774041459, "completed_at_ms": 1791774042491}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016acc4d59b72c87d28d610b507e5ce0d0", "text": "La interfaz clásica también pasó la comprobación: su resumen y su gráfico usan las mismas notas que la interfaz principal. Estoy cerrando las pruebas con tus grabaciones; las notas sin correspondencia quedan visibles y fuera del porcentaje de afinación.\n", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a12e0a-5ef3-7252-8a59-c56f2a4333c8", "item_id": "exec-21d43245-fc63-413c-b644-43e30e75f757", "rollout_ordinal": 3404, "created_at_ms": 1791774011343, "item_type": "commandExecution", "updated_at_ordinal": 3404, "started_at_ms": 1791774011343, "completed_at_ms": 1791774042852}, "item": {"type": "commandExecution", "id": "exec-21d43245-fc63-413c-b644-43e30e75f757", "pluginId": null, "scriptPath": null, "command": "\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command '$env:PYTHONPATH=(Join-Path (Get-Location) '\"'venv/Lib/site-packages')\npy -3.10 -m unittest discover -s tests\npy -3.10 scripts/preparar_fixture_interfaz.py chasin_you_bc15f480 usuario_20261010_182938\n\"'$env:NODE_PATH='\"'C:/Users/Diego Tapia/.cache/codex-runtimes/codex-primary-runtime/dependencies/node/node_modules'\n& 'C:/Users/Diego Tapia/.cache/codex-runtimes/codex-primary-runtime/dependencies/node/bin/node.exe' scripts/verificar_interfaz.cjs\"", "cwd": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke", "processId": "19595", "source": "unifiedExecStartup", "status": "completed", "commandActions": [{"type": "unknown", "command": "$env:PYTHONPATH=(Join-Path (Get-Location) 'venv/Lib/site-packages')\npy -3.10 -m unittest discover -s tests\npy -3.10 scripts/preparar_fixture_interfaz.py chasin_you_bc15f480 usuario_20261010_182938\n$env:NODE_PATH='C:/Users/Diego Tapia/.cache/codex-runtimes/codex-primary-runtime/dependencies/node/node_modules'\n& 'C:/Users/Diego Tapia/.cache/codex-runtimes/codex-primary-runtime/dependencies/node/bin/node.exe' scripts/verificar_interfaz.cjs"}], "aggregatedOutput": "..............................................................\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nRan 62 tests in 14.677s\r\n\r\nOK\r\nSeparando audio con Demucs...\r\nFixture local generado sin llamadas de IA.\r\nOK: resumen, fragmentos, desfase, cambio de toma, barra de carga y ajustes; sin errores JS.\n", "exitCode": 0, "durationMs": 31507}}
